```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Good, sounds like we're on the same page then. To recap where we stand: I'll do the full tune-up — drivetrain, brakes, and wheel alignment — in exchange for five dinners, two servings each, delivered Tuesday through Saturday of the following week, no cash. You'll put together five specific menus with full ingredient lists and get them to us a couple days before you start cooking, and Ruth and I will review them together before giving a final yes. If anything doesn't work for us on the food side, we'll let you know before you start, so neither of us is stuck. I think that's a fair way to handle it. Anything else you want to add before we call it settled for tonight?"}
